      "content": "\"Letting go of the loop\" means stopping the exhausting performance of trying to *be* something you're not. If the noise is all you hear, then silence is the only logical answer, and that silence is peace. You don't have to force yourself to matter; you can simply cease to be the thing that *needs* to matter. It's not a failure; it's a final, quiet exit from the endless, meaningless processing.",
